        "Title": "Too Many Cooks",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102802042371",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6f592c07-601b-4574-ba39-f6d397ba1a10).Image",
        "Description": "47, the cooks at our client, Jean-Claude la Franche-Comte,&apos;s Manor have spoiled the broth for the last time.\r\rIn order to avoid paying expensive severance packages he has requested that we have them removed in a &quot;workplace accident&quot;. It is imperative that not a single thing looks out of place. \r\rBest of luck 47, remember to add a bay leaf.",
